Strata: llama_set_adapter_ablation_mid - the directions of llama_set_adapter_ablation also removed right after each
layer's attention (qwen35moe), before the feed-forward / experts read the stream, as orthogonalizing the attention's
output weights would.  strata-metal --ablate-mid turns it on.

